                <pb facs="0239" n="155" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg155"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Beaupré to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-06-23"><hi rendition="#italic">June 23, 1903</hi></date>.
                        (Received June 27, 1903.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Confidential. Friends of the Government have control in Congress. I believe any
                    legislation seriously desired by the Government will pass.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaupré.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
